t system - doesn't like to be stuck in a level and come back later? Just use the hint system for clues. But challenges will stay challenging! You don't need to pass them all to access the end of the game<br><br>",
    "short_description": "Your destruction isn't the end you think; if it's a projectile, it is removed from the puzzle and you are instantly respawned. Consequence? It disrupts the level's balance! Exploit this to defeat enemies and open new paths! Playing the disruptive kamikaze is the key to your success!",
